!runs/seeded_overnight/founders.json
!runs/seeded_overnight/founders_manifest.json
!runs/seeded_overnight/HARVEST.md
!runs/seeded_overnight/harvest_best.json
# D46 run config: founder bank + Sebastian pop snapshot + run README
!runs/seeded_d46/
runs/seeded_d46/*
!runs/seeded_d46/README.md
!runs/seeded_d46/founders.json
!runs/seeded_d46/seb_v3_rainbow_pops.json

